; No direct path between computers on this host (relay-fallbacks, PREDICTIONS.md):
; everything allowed but UDP sent to any of this host's own addresses, which
; the profile's "localhost" covers, loopback, LAN and Tailscale alike
; (demo/runs/mesh-offline/2026-11-01/README.md, finding 4). iroh's direct
; paths are UDP, its relays TCP, so two computers here reach each other
; only through a relay; UDP off this host, n0's address discovery among it,
; still goes. run.py checks it against planted sends first.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network-outbound (remote udp "localhost:*"))
